@title Cabinet heat: wires in the ducts add heat
@area Heat
@slow
@sizes 1920x1080
# 1920x1080 only: at 1366x768 the Cabinet heat run stays at "starting" in the QA harness (scenario 30 shows the same). Cabinet with every wire sized: the power wires lie in the ducts, so the heat run counts their I2R loss and the Temperature panel says what it rests on (currents, copper temperature, no diversity).
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-wire-heat.novo
wait 20
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 20
